('text.persia.dsab','DSab Trilingual Inscription','DSab 三语楔形文字铭文',NULL,'DSab','TEXT','civ.persian','region.west_asia','Reign of Darius I, 522-486 BCE','苏萨大流士雕像上的古波斯语、埃兰语与阿卡德语三语铭文；三个语言版本作为同一铭文组的独立见证。 / Trilingual cuneiform inscription on the Darius statue, with Old Persian, Elamite and Akkadian witnesses.','PARTIAL','SOURCE_BACKED',1,'{"inscription_code":"DSab","witness_model":"parallel language versions","object_id":"museum.iran.darius_susa_statue"}','2026-08-26T00:00:00Z','2026-08-26T00:00:00Z'),
('text.persia.dsab.old_persian','DSab Old Persian Version','DSab 古波斯语版本',NULL,NULL,'TEXT','civ.persian','region.west_asia','Reign of Darius I, 522-486 BCE','DSab 的古波斯语版本，单独保存语言、载体与版本证据。 / Old Persian version of DSab, retained as a distinct textual witness.','PARTIAL','SOURCE_BACKED',1,'{"parent_inscription":"text.persia.dsab","language":"lang.peo"}','2026-08-26T00:00:00Z','2026-08-26T00:00:00Z'),
('text.persia.dsab.elamite','DSab Elamite Version','DSab 埃兰语版本',NULL,NULL,'TEXT','civ.persian','region.west_asia','Reign of Darius I, 522-486 BCE','DSab 的埃兰语版本，不与古波斯语或阿卡德语文本合并。 / Elamite version of DSab, retained independently.','PARTIAL','SOURCE_BACKED',1,'{"parent_inscription":"text.persia.dsab","language":"lang.elx"}','2026-08-26T00:00:00Z','2026-08-26T00:00:00Z'),
('text.persia.dsab.akkadian','DSab Akkadian Version','DSab 阿卡德语版本',NULL,NULL,'TEXT','civ.babylonian','region.west_asia','Reign of Darius I, 522-486 BCE','DSab 的阿卡德语版本，作为阿契美尼德王室多语铭文的一层。 / Akkadian version of DSab in the Achaemenid multilingual program.','PARTIAL','SOURCE_BACKED',1,'{"parent_inscription":"text.persia.dsab","language":"lang.akk"}','2026-08-26T00:00:00Z','2026-08-26T00:00:00Z'),
('text.egypt.darius_susa_hieroglyphic_program','Darius Susa Statue Hieroglyphic Program','苏萨大流士雕像象形文字铭文组',NULL,NULL,'TEXT','civ.egyptian','region.northeast_africa','Egyptian Dynasty 27 / reign of Darius I','雕像上的五组埃及象形文字文本总档；与 DSab 三语楔形文字铭文分开。 / Corpus record for five hieroglyphic texts on the statue, separate from DSab.','PARTIAL','SOURCE_BACKED',1,'{"witness_count":5,"language":"lang.egy","object_id":"museum.iran.darius_susa_statue"}','2026-08-26T00:00:00Z','2026-08-26T00:00:00Z'),
('text.egypt.darius_susa_hieroglyphic_province_list','Darius Statue Hieroglyphic Subject-Peoples List','大流士雕像象形文字属地名单',NULL,NULL,'TEXT','civ.egyptian','region.northeast_africa','Egyptian Dynasty 27 / reign of Darius I','雕像基座两侧人物与椭圆名框组成的属地名单；当前基线登记二十四个形象，不把其直接等同于现代国家。 / Base list of twenty-four labelled subject figures; ancient labels are not automatically mapped to modern states.','PARTIAL','SOURCE_BACKED',1,'{"hieroglyphic_text_number":5,"figure_count":24,"mapping_guard":"ancient ethnonyms are not modern-state identities"}','2026-08-26T00:00:00Z','2026-08-26T00:00:00Z'),
('concept.persia.darius_statue_subject_peoples','Darius Statue Subject Peoples','大流士雕像属民表现体系',NULL,NULL,'CONCEPT','civ.persian','region.west_asia','Reign of Darius I, 522-486 BCE','用于连接基座人物、象形文字名框与帝国属地表达的比较实体，不宣称名单等于固定民族或现代疆界。 / Comparison concept linking base figures, cartouches and imperial subject representation without modern ethnic equivalence.','PARTIAL','SOURCE_BACKED',1,'{"comparison_only":true,"no_modern_ethnic_equivalence":true}','2026-08-26T00:00:00Z','2026-08-26T00:00:00Z');

